flowchart TD
    S1["1 · Authorized target + context<br/>toy app / Grafana 8.3.0 / budget"]:::ext --> S2
    S2["2 · Context profiler<br/>Python gathers technology facts"]:::code --> S3
    S3["3 · LLM planner<br/>picks approved template IDs + a reason"]:::model --> S4
    S4{"4 · Policy gate — CODE<br/>in scope? allowed? in budget?"}:::code
    S4 -->|blocked| BLK["Block + log"]:::code
    S4 -->|approved| RUN["Nuclei CLI runs the template"]:::code
    RUN --> S5["5 · Evidence parser + LLM review<br/>pick ONE follow-up, or stop"]:::model
    S5 -->|"follow-up, max 1"| S4
    S5 --> S6["6 · Evidence verifier + report<br/>rule-based status + business priority"]:::code
    CAT[("Approved catalog<br/>reviewed templates + budget")]:::code --> S3
    ENF["Enforced in Python<br/>allowlist · rate limit · no OAST · stop flag · JSONL log"]:::code -.-> S4
    KILL[["Stop switch"]]:::stop -.-> RUN

